1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,860
Want to move beads like a pro?

2
00:00:02,660 --> 00:00:04,560
Let's learn the secret fingers!

3
00:00:05,660 --> 00:00:07,860
Going up always uses your thumb.

4
00:00:09,060 --> 00:00:11,960
Watch — thumb pushes this lower bead up!

5
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:16,120
Going down always uses your index finger.

6
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:20,620
Watch — index finger brings the upper bead down!

7
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:27,820
It's the same rule for taking away — index finger going down, thumb going up!

8
00:00:27,820 --> 00:00:29,780
Up is thumb.

9
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:31,960
Down is index finger.

10
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:34,040
Every single time!

11
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:40,040
Learn it all with Abacus Kids — free on the App Store and Google Play!
